mper, egocentric, not open to new ideas). So I will recommend Candidate B, but note concerns.\n\nThus public message: state recommendation Candidate B, reference no prior discussion, give evidence: very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, but also mention communication issues. Explain why still best.\n\nWe also need to update structured notes? Not required in output.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
